{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026V5NHqiEXzd1795434995.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本神戶旅遊熱點異人館，今年的聖誕老人裝飾穿上灰色裝束，反映民眾對物價高企的關注。</p><p></p><p>距離聖誕節還有約一個月，日本神戶北野旅遊熱點異人館「魚鱗之家」上周四起，按慣例展示反映年度世態的聖誕老人，今年因物價上漲，聖誕老人買不起紅袍，改穿灰色便服亮相。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-23-19h53m36s268.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202635UsPie8bk1795435012.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>館方表示，原本希望年度世態聖誕老人主題，能回顧一些令人振奮的話題，但受到物價上漲影響，很難做到。以發泡膠製成、約3米高的灰衣版聖誕老人展期至下月27日。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-23-19h53m46s842.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fcfbwQaynk1795435030.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>共同社報道，中東戰事推高燃料和原材料成本，日本通脹今年持續上升，總務省公布數據顯示，當地10月消費者物價指數，較去年同期上升百分之2.2，升幅較上月擴大0.1個百分點，是連續兩個月超過日本央行設定百分之二的目標。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-23-19h53m55s684.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026giMSS4C6671795435046.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>世態聖誕老人活動2009年起舉辦，今年是第18屆，去年展示的聖誕老人造型則融入大阪關西世博會，吉祥物「脈脈」的元素。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-23-19h54m17s515.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OTveLReZrc1795435060.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.880423+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:57:14.309618+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:13.970098+00:00","content_hash":"e96e6fbeca9f20f493bb1400ed6f85206f50344b5296aeb22fceb8f28a4dda58","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.880423+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}